# Deny-by-default: only what the running services actually import ships in
# the image. Previously an allow-list of 8 exclusions, which meant .env,
# config/config.yaml, and every untracked *.bak file were being baked into
# every build (Dockerfile's COPY --chown=soc_user:soc_user . . copies
# anything not excluded here).
*

!requirements.txt
!api/
!inference/
!ingest/
!shared/
!scripts/
!terminal/
# inference/models.py loads models/cnn_dga.pt (and its .sha256) at a
# path relative to WORKDIR /app -- without this the container's own
# fail-safe integrity check has nothing to load and crashes at startup.
!models/
!models/*.pt
!models/*.sha256

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.bak
**/.DS_Store
